Interaction_PinchView","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pinch to scale a shape. A magnification (pinch) gesture drives an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.PopSwitch"},{"type":"text","text":" whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"state feeds the shape’s Transform Scale ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"builtin.point3D"},{"type":"text","text":"); releasing the pinch “pops” the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"switch to its nearest state with a spring. At rest a white triangle sits at its base scale on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the magenta artboard."}],"type":"topic"}}}